03:44.168 --> 03:47.522
x squared

03:47.522 --> 03:49.751
divided by 35.

03:51.001 --> 03:52.586
Close that parentheses.

03:52.586 --> 03:55.105
So that is my function there.

03:55.105 --> 03:57.616
Actually, I don't know if
it's going to understand.

04:02.054 --> 04:06.303
Let me put the times 2nd, insert, times

04:06.303 --> 04:08.381
