integrating with respect to x.

04:15.440 --> 04:17.356
I could've put a t here

04:17.356 --> 04:18.761
and integrated it with respect to t,

04:18.761 --> 04:20.270
we would get the same value.

04:20.270 --> 04:22.917
Comma, my lower bound is 0.

04:22.917 --> 04:25.425
And my upper bound is 8.

04:25.425 --> 04:27.364
And then close the parentheses

04:27.364 --> 04:30.213
and let the calculator
munch on it a little bit.

04:30.213 --> 04:31.378
And we get

04:31.378 --> 04:34.861
76.570

04:34.861 --> 04:36.530
so this is

04:36.530 --> 04:38.565
approximately

04:38.565 --> 04:40.014
Seventy-six

04:40.014 --> 04:41.071
point

04:41.071 --> 04:44.647
five, seven, zero.

04:44.647 --> 04:46.215
Now let's tackle the next part.

