So that means that water in pipe,

05:51.049 --> 05:53.440
let me right then,

05:53.440 --> 05:54.539
then

05:54.539 --> 05:56.552
water

05:56.552 --> 05:59.034
in pipe

05:59.034 --> 06:00.387
Increasing.

06:01.547 --> 06:02.577
Increasing.

06:03.717 --> 06:05.747
And then if it's the other way around,

06:05.747 --> 06:08.034
