06:08.034 --> 06:10.519
is greater than R of 3,

06:10.519 --> 06:12.818
then water in pipe decreasing,

06:12.818 --> 06:14.791
then you're draining faster
than you're putting into it.

06:15.871 --> 06:20.834
Then water in pipe

06:20.834 --> 06:22.290
decreasing.

06:22.290 --> 06:23.290
decreasing.

06:23.290 --> 06:26.215
So we just have to evaluate
these functions at 3.

